  "description": "Baek Ho-Su and Tae Jeong-Ha have been inseparable best friends for over a decade and live-in boyfriends for a year. But Hosu is tired of feeling like the only one trying in a relationship that feels completely one-sided. Convinced Jeong-Ha doesn't love him back, Hosu finally calls it quits. \n\nHe is ready to start fresh, but he completely forgot one massive detail: they are a registered campus couple! Everywhere he goes, there’s Jeong-Ha, looking as calm, handsome, and frustratingly unbothered as ever. Hosu wants a perfect, clean break, but the universe, and maybe a very scheming, devoted ex-boyfriend, has other plans.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
